  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e7df69920aa9bc042ab389e85540d4df, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Eh, nyari sesuatu?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f617a7de34d31a409436afbe0a1465e, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Lagi perhatiin orang-orang. Kamu lihat ada yang aneh di sini?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77b0eead442c177428e9226b312e2983, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c176813ad7a142d40916b462531f639b, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Tadi aku lewat ruang karaoke. Ada seorang pria duduk sendiri di pojok.
      Anehnya, dia nggak nyanyi sama sekali, malah fokus banget ke laptop.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 516b413fcc7faf940aba46c1e920a202, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Dia bawa tas besar, ada kabel-kabel keluar dan kotak kecil nyala-nyala
      di mejanya.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f2cd0c2004ea9334b9938912b0f4ee0f, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Kabel networking?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b71418ddffb2c646856bb98371f3b77, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d4a247f14498424ca8b0dd5ad5a4ead, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Kayaknya iya. Aku nggak ngerti teknis, tapi rasanya nggak lazim buat orang
      yang katanya mau karaoke.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 92b7d4f263c85cb4092e34b88963b7c2, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Oke, makasih infonya.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4e9de9a1d52a1a345b3e7729b8f280be, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8efc99e3bd839b49a51e092afd9e252, type: 3}
  hasChoice: 0
  acceptText: Ya
  rejectText: Tidak
  dialogueIfAccepted: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueIfRejected: {fileID: 0}
